  "description": "Soups are such a dinner-time staple as they are always brimming with such warm and homey flavours. Packed into this soup are several hidden veggies and smooth butter beans, waiting to be soaked up by cheesy ciabatta! This recipe is under 650kcal per serving. Unfortunately, this week's butter beans were in short supply, so we've replaced them with red kidney beans. Don't worry, the recipe will be just as delicious, just be sure to follow your recipe card!",
