  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop carrot, zucchini and potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Bake until tender, 25-30 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Roughly chop silverbeet.\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2bd6628e8000a2e057e4a/step-084a1cec.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat. Add the butter, garlic & herb seasoning and 1/2 of the garlic. Cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2bd6628e8000a2e057e4a/step-4fa1c0b2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add red kidney beans, diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, the brown sugar and the water.\n• Bring to a boil, then turn the heat down to medium-low and simmer until slightly reduced, 10-15 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2bd6628e8000a2e057e4a/step-52e88575.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the soup is simmering, add the remaining garlic and a drizzle of olive oil to a small bowl.\n• Slice bake-at-home ciabatta in half and place cut-side up onto a second lined baking tray.\n• Drizzle the garlic oil over the bread and sprinkle with shaved Parmesan cheese (reserve a pinch for garnishing the soup later).\n• Place the ciabatta in the oven, and bake until the cheese is melted and bubbling, 3-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2bd6628e8000a2e057e4a/step-6d020dd4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the roasted veggies and silverbeet to the pan. Stir and cook until softened, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2bd6628e8000a2e057e4a/step-4d35a918.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the Mediterranean tomato and bean soup between bowls and top with the reserved parmesan cheese.\n• Slice cheesy garlic ciabatta to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a2bd6628e8000a2e057e4a/step-af8cb5ff.jpg"
    }
  ]
